There are six ways to color the equilateral triangle on the left.  Without loss of generality, assume it is colored as below.

[asy]
draw((-75,0)--(-45,0)--(-60,26)--cycle);
draw((0,0)--(30,0)--(15,26)--cycle);
draw((75,0)--(105,0)--(90,26)--cycle);
